{"about_the_game":"\ud83d\udd25 LUST Eternal \ud83d\udd1e \u2014 a hellish, fast-paced shooter where brutal carnage and sinful pleasures collide in an infernal dance of chaos. You\u2019re not a victim. You\u2019re the huntress.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/segment_1-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1743536410\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc80 STORY</h2>You are a sinner, wandering through the burning wastelands of hell, hiding from the horrors that lurk in the shadows. Starving, desperate\u2026 until you stumble upon the corpse of a fallen warrior. A powerful weapon lies beside him.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/segment_boss.gif?t=1743536410\" /><br>Hunger takes over. As you devour his brain, flashes of his memories ignite inside you\u2014visions of slaughter, of demons torn apart by his hands. The last bite seals your fate.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/segment_4-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1743536410\" /><br>With a shotgun in hand, you rise from the ashes, let out a bloodcurdling scream\u2014&quot;AAAAAHHHH!&quot;\u2014and unleash absolute carnage upon the underworld.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/segment_fury.gif?t=1743536410\" /><br>The deeper you go, the stronger your enemies become. But the greater the challenge, the sweeter the reward\u2014defeat Hell\u2019s guardians, and indulge in sinful pleasures with the most tempting succubi and demons.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/segment_2-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1743536410\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 GAMEPLAY FEATURES</h2>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fast-paced, brutal combat</strong> \u2013 run, shoot, tear through your enemies, leave nothing but blood and ashes.<br>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Savage executions </strong>\u2013 rip demons apart with your bare hands, feel the raw power of destruction.<br>\ud83d\udc7f <strong>Seductive rewards </strong>\u2013 prove your dominance, and Hell\u2019s most alluring creatures will be yours to enjoy.<br>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>An arsenal of destruction</strong> \u2013 find and upgrade weapons, experiment with different playstyles.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Epic boss battles</strong> \u2013 crush Hell\u2019s guardians and fight your way deeper into chaos and temptation.<br><br><strong><u>\ud83d\udda4 Hell is yours to conquer. Will you burn it to the ground or revel in its sinful delights?</u></strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571560?t=1743536410","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571560?t=1743536410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/b3505f6d481a7397072304b92fd7201ffcb64d3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743536410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/b3505f6d481a7397072304b92fd7201ffcb64d3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743536410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit sexual content, nudity, and graphic violence. It features sexual acts and frequent gore. All characters depicted in sexual situations are 18+."},"detailed_description":"\ud83d\udd25 LUST Eternal \ud83d\udd1e \u2014 a hellish, fast-paced shooter where brutal carnage and sinful pleasures collide in an infernal dance of chaos. You\u2019re not a victim. You\u2019re the huntress.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571560/extras/segment_1-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1743536410\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\